          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "YM.Extra.Histories.Attach.always_meets",
            "lines": [
              26,
              31
            ],
            "conclusion": "By exact coverage of the flags by the inventories, an admissible family on an unhealthy configuration has a forced term meeting the footprint `Y`; so if none meets it, the configuration is healthy."
